.SH AUTHORIZATION
Service management commands (start, stop, restart, enable, disable) require
either root privileges or membership in the
.B nftban-cli
group (via Polkit).

Add user to nftban-cli group:
.RS
.B usermod \-aG nftban-cli username
.RE

